            "line": 272,
            "text": "theorem angular_source_logarithmic_form\n    (h η x W U H Hx Hη : ℝ) (hH : H ≠ 0) :\n    H * (-W * (x * Hx / H) - h * (1 - 2 * η * U) -\n      (axialExponent h * η + coordinateFactor η * U) * (Hη / H)) =\n      angularSource h η x W U H Hx Hη"
